<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
    <!-- Note: .NET 10 does not exist yet. As of 2024, the latest LTS is .NET 8.0 -->
    <!-- If you meant .NET 8.0, use net8.0. If you meant .NET 9.0 (preview), use net9.0 -->
    <OutputType>Library</OutputType>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    
    <!-- Best Practice: Add LangVersion for explicit C# version control -->
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    
    <!-- Best Practice: Enable deterministic builds for reproducibility -->
    <Deterministic>true</Deterministic>
    
    <!-- Best Practice: Enable continuous integration build flag -->
    <ContinuousIntegrationBuild Condition="'$(CI)' == 'true'">true</ContinuousIntegrationBuild>
    
    <!-- Best Practice: Generate XML documentation for library projects -->
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    
    <!-- Best Practice: Treat warnings as errors in production code -->
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>false</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
    <WarningsAsErrors />
    
    <!-- Best Practice: Enable NuGet package generation metadata if this will be packaged -->
    <!-- <GeneratePackageOnBuild>false</GeneratePackageOnBuild> -->
    <!-- <Authors>Your Team</Authors> -->
    <!-- <Company>Your Company</Company> -->
    <!-- <Product>AphaBatchJobs</Product> -->
    <!-- <Description>Core library for Apha Batch Jobs</Description> -->
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- Best Practice: Add ItemGroup for common analyzers and code quality tools -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- Uncomment when ready to add dependencies -->
    <!-- <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions" Version="8.*" /> -->
    <!-- <PackageReference Include="Npgsql" Version="8.*" /> -->
    <!-- <PackageReference Include="AWSSDK.Core" Version="3.*" /> -->
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>


**Key Changes Made:**

1. **Critical Fix**: Changed `net10.0` to `net8.0` - .NET 10 doesn't exist yet. The latest stable version is .NET 8.0 (LTS).

2. **Added `LangVersion`**: Explicitly set to `latest` for better control over C# language features.

3. **Added `Deterministic`**: Ensures reproducible builds, important for CI/CD pipelines and AWS deployments.

4. **Added `ContinuousIntegrationBuild`**: Optimizes builds for CI environments (AWS CodeBuild, GitHub Actions, etc.).

5. **Added `GenerateDocumentationFile`**: Best practice for library projects to generate XML documentation.

6. **Added warning configuration**: Prepared structure for treating warnings as errors (currently disabled but ready to enable).

7. **Added commented package metadata**: Template for NuGet package generation if needed.

8. **Added commented ItemGroup**: Placeholder for common dependencies (PostgreSQL via Npgsql, AWS SDK, logging abstractions) that a batch job core library would typically need.